// The coordinate extent, which is what "spans the entire int range" was.
//
// A showroom is a room: every coordinate belongs inside a box a few metres on a
// side. Printing the extent rather than a checksum makes a regression legible --
// a wrong pointer shows up as millions, not as a different hash.

t_span() {
  t_span_x();
  t_span_y();
  t_span2();
} return void;

t_span2() {
  t_span_z();
  t_scene();
} return void;

